## Context
Child of tracker 1252 (forge-less raid, gaze and merge); design in 1252's `## Raid annotation (design, 2026-10-27)` and `## Advisor ruling (2026-10-27)`.
Ruling point 1: one notes ref `refs/notes/review`, append-only entries with a `kind:` field
(request|plan|report|answer|verdict), written through one helper `scripts/review_notes.py` that reuses
merge-gate.py's fetch/append/push; never raw `git notes` in a skill. Hunt's Review calls gaze on both routes.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] gaze reviews a branch range (`branch:<name>`) with no forge and records its result where the gate reads it.
- [ ] The forge path is unchanged (its tests pass); the harness gate passes.

Related: [[1252]].
